OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy from Inverness
OL,6,Fand in the east up to Caithness, with
OL,7,Fa small chance of the odd light shower
OL,8,Fappearing. Elsewhere dry with brighter
OL,9,Fspells in the west, which build into
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry. Rather cloudy in
OL,13,Feast and north. Clear spells focused
OL,14,Fin west. Risk of Fog and rural frost,
OL,15,Fchiefly around northern end of Great
OL,16,FGlen, Easter Ross and Sutherland.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FSettled and dry fare with
OL,19,Fbright and sunny spells increasing,
OL,20,Fbut early mist and fog may be slow to
OL,21,Fburn back. Winds light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
