OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday dry with sunshine and light
OL,7,Fwinds. Friday cloudier with the chance
OL,8,Fof drizzly showers for Inverness.
OL,9,FSaturday cloudy but largely dry.
